\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Jesus hath died and hath risen again,
\par Pardon and peace to bestow;
\par Fully I trust Him; from sin's guilty stain
\par Jesus saves me now.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Jesus saves me now!
\par Jesus saves me now!
\par Yes, Jesus saves me all the time,
\par Jesus saves me now!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Sin's condemnation is over and gone,
\par Jesus alone knoweth how,
\par Life and salvation my soul hath put on;
\par Jesus saves me now.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Jesus saves me now!
\par Jesus saves me now!
\par Yes, Jesus saves me all the time,
\par Jesus saves me now!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Jesus is stronger than Satan and sin,
\par Satan to Jesus must bow,
\par Therefore I triumph without and within;
\par Jesus saves me now.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Jesus saves me now!
\par Jesus saves me now!
\par Yes, Jesus saves me all the time,
\par Jesus saves me now!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Sorrow and pain may beset me about,
\par Nothing can darken my brow;
\par Battling in faith I can joyfully shout:
\par Jesus saves me now.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Jesus saves me now!
\par Jesus saves me now!
\par Yes, Jesus saves me all the time,
\par Jesus saves me now!
\par \f1 
